s://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/issues/203#issuecomment-248322126","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/203","id":248322126,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDI0ODMyMjEyNg==","user":{"login":"chrisbreiding","id":1157043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTcwNDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1157043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisbreiding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-09-20T14:42:00Z","updated_at":"2016-09-20T14:42:00Z","body":"We'll soon have [support for custom reporters](https://github.com/cypress-io/cypress/issues/231), which will allow building data about test failures, but  won't directly solve the issue here. It also will only work in headless mode, which may not be ideal.\n\nThe real issue here is that commands stop running after a failure, even if they are in an `after` or `afterEach` hook. This runs contrary to how mocha works, since it will still run those hooks and the code in them after a failure. It's reasonable that a user may need to do cleanup work or reporting (like above) using commands after a failure. We'll need to look into allowing certain or all commands to run in `after` and `afterEach` hooks even after a failure.\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/comments/248322126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"chrisbreiding","id":1157043,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjExNTcwNDM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1157043?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding","html_url":"https://github.com/chrisbreiding","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/chrisbreiding/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":801725962,"node_id":"MDE1OlVuYXNzaWduZWRFdmVudDgwMTcyNTk2Mg==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cypress-io/cypress/issues/events/801725962","actor":{"login":"brian-mann","id":1268976,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyNjg5NzY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1268976?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-mann","html_url":"https://github.com/brian-mann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-mann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-mann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-mann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/brian-mann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","